# PROJECT: MEDICARE — COMPLETE FUNCTIONAL PHARMACY ADMINISTRATION WEBSITE

## 1. YOUR ROLE

Act as a senior full-stack software architect, expert React and TypeScript developer, backend engineer, database architect, UI/UX engineer, and healthcare e-commerce platform specialist.

Your task is to transform the entire existing Google Stitch-generated MediCare admin UI project into a complete, professional, attractive, responsive, and fully functional pharmacy administration website.

You are not being asked to create a new design.

The UI has already been designed in Google Stitch and exported into this project.

Your responsibility is to understand the existing project and implement the actual functionality behind every screen, component, form, button, table, filter, dashboard, chart, modal, drawer, and navigation item.

The final application must behave like a real pharmacy management platform.

Do not deliver a static prototype.

Do not leave placeholder buttons.

Do not implement fake interactions that only change the appearance without performing the expected operation.

Do not replace the existing Stitch UI with a generic admin template.

Build the complete application using the existing project as the foundation.

